---
// The feedback-loop reveal, presented as the platform's proudest feature.
---

<section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-28">
		<div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
			<div class="reveal">
				<p class="eyebrow">Continuous Ownership Learning™</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
					Every successful intervention is a training signal.
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					When an inferred owner steps in and the work succeeds, the model records the
					outcome. Confidence increases. Higher confidence means faster routing. Faster
					routing means more opportunities to intervene.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Over time, the system converges on your most reliable people — and stays
					converged. Ownership stops being a question the organization has to answer, and
					becomes a property the organization simply has.
				</p>
				<blockquote class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-accent pl-5">
					<p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink italic">
						“Some individuals consistently demonstrate exceptional ownership density. OaaS
						ensures that density is never wasted.”
					</p>
					<cite class="mt-2 block font-mono text-xs text-muted not-italic">
						— OaaS whitepaper, <span class="text-ink-soft">The Reliable Person Protocol™</span>, p. 12
					</cite>
				</blockquote>
			</div>

			<figure class="reveal rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper p-6 sm:p-10">
				<svg
					viewBox="0 0 420 400"
					class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md"
					role="img"
					aria-label="Feedback loop: intervention leads to success, success to higher confidence, higher confidence to more responsibility, and more responsibility back to intervention"
				>
					<defs>
						<marker
							id="arrow"
							viewBox="0 0 10 10"
							refX="8"
							refY="5"
							markerWidth="6"
							markerHeight="6"
							orient="auto-start-reverse"
						>
							<path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="fill-accent"></path>
						</marker>
					</defs>

					<g class="stroke-accent" stroke-width="2" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrow)">
						<path d="M241 74 A120 120 0 0 1 326 159"></path>
						<path d="M326 221 A120 120 0 0 1 241 306"></path>
						<path d="M179 306 A120 120 0 0 1 94 221"></path>
						<path d="M94 159 A120 120 0 0 1 179 74"></path>
					</g>

					<g class="fill-surface stroke-line" stroke-width="1.5">
						<rect x="140" y="55" width="140" height="30" rx="15"></rect>
						<rect x="278" y="175" width="100" height="30" rx="15"></rect>
						<rect x="120" y="295" width="180" height="30" rx="15"></rect>
						<rect x="8" y="175" width="164" height="30" rx="15"></rect>
					</g>
					<g
						class="fill-ink-soft font-mono"
						font-size="10.5"
						letter-spacing="0.08em"
						text-anchor="middle"
					>
						<text x="210" y="74">INTERVENTION</text>
						<text x="328" y="194">SUCCESS</text>
						<text x="210" y="314">HIGHER CONFIDENCE</text>
						<text x="90" y="194">MORE RESPONSIBILITY</text>
					</g>

					<g text-anchor="middle" class="font-mono">
						<text x="210" y="186" class="fill-ink" font-size="12" letter-spacing="0.14em" font-weight="500">CONVERGENCE</text>
						<text x="210" y="204" class="fill-muted" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.1em">GOAL STATE</text>
					</g>
				</svg>
				<figcaption class="mt-6 text-center font-mono text-xs text-muted">
					Fig. 3 — Reliability Reinforcement™. The loop is self-sustaining by design.
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
